About kdegraphics
-----------------
kdegraphics is a collection of graphic oriented applications.  This
version keeps only:

* doc
    XML based documentation for the programs.

* kruler
    A ruler in inch, centimeter and pixel to check distances on the screen.

* ksnapshot
    Make snapshots of the screen contents.

* kview
    Picture viewer, provided as standalone program and embeddable KPart.


Building
--------
kdegraphics builds with CMake against the CMake package of kdelibs
(KDE3Libs), which also gives the install prefix:

    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo \
          -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/opt/kde3
    cmake --build build
    cmake --install build

Options: KDEGRAPHICS_WITH_XSHAPE (default ON) cuts shaped windows to
their shape in KSnapshot; it needs the X Shape extension (libXext).


More Info
---------
Please direct any bug reports to our bug list by visiting
http://bugs.kde.org.

General KDE discussions should go to the KDE mailing list (kde@kde.org).


